</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, March 13, 2005 - 11:33 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tac I took your advice and went over to the Zodiac site, I saw the stuff about the Singapore Slinger and The alias&#39; Jacob William Ornstein and Jack Yohiel Alexander that Tom wanted info on I looked them us and found Jacob Ornstien and  william gage, they wrote a book A Basic INtroduction to Language Science and the name Jack William Alexander Nickname &#34;Yohiel&#34; an artist Why is Tom so worryed about This Slinger guy, sorry if this doesn&#39;t fit here. I just wondered.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
