<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12376"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 29, 2005 - 12:55 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Have you guys ever read the Book Behold a Pale Rider, by William Cooper ex-CIA He has all the Official Docs. in the Book on the drug runnning in the military from back then. Talks a lot about Panama, Here is a good example from his book, 11/12/89 Cocaine seized On Air Force plane, Dover Del. Authoritis seid 66 pounds of cocaine that was flown aboard an Air Force cargo plane from Panama to Dover<!--/Text--></td></tr>
