<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12523"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, April 01, 2005 - 5:05 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Yes that is a good point, remember the comment in Otero thread about Joe&#39;s Birth cert. saying he was born in New York and Charlie said it was a mistake. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
