<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13000"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, April 19, 2005 - 10:08 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTW guys the 340 is solved, It took me two weeks of non stop insanity.   So who is crazy now? LOL<!--/Text--></td></tr>
